flowchart TD
  accTitle: Home Server Admin Dashboard
  accDescr {
    NutsNews includes a protected admin dashboard for monitoring the home server that runs local AI.
  }
  A[Admin browser opens /admin/home-server] --> B[Protected Next.js route]
  B --> C{Server-side fetch with HOME_SERVER_STATS_URL + API key}
  C --> D[GET /stats at ai.nutsnews.com]
  D --> E[local-ai-service validates x-nutsnews-ai-key]
  E --> F[Collect hostname, CPU, memory, disk, services, localAi, ollama]
  F --> G[Render dashboard server-side in admin page]
  G --> H[Page stays read-only and shows only non-sensitive health metrics]
  C -->|invalid key| I[Block fetch and show error state]
